{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And until, etc.</b> By way of illustration: from the day they were with HaShem until eternity." "<b>I have made.</b> Israel — and not like the gods of Babylon, for the Babylonians make their gods, whereas I bear them and deliver them; and not like them, for they could not deliver from a burden."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:15.982617307Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}